		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Great white whales with two massive arms ending in crab claws. Harbingers of the end of times. Omens and portents foretell a behemoth.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 69, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw (near) +10 (6d6) or 1 water jet (far), <strong>MV</strong> far (swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> -3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 14</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Capsize</strong>. Opposed STR versus captain's INT or ship is capsized and begins to sink. Behemoth has ADV.</p><p></p><p><strong>Divine</strong>. Immune to damage from non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 20 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Water Jet</strong>. All creatures in a near-sized cube take 4d8 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
